  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Chọn hệ toạ độ như hình vẽ.<br>Cổng chào có dạng đường parabol có phương trình<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Theo bài ra parabol đi qua các điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có hệ\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>81</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>18</mn><mn>35</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>81</mn><mn>35</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>Toạ độ của đỉnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>729</mn><mn>280</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy chiều cao cổng chào là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>729</mn><mn>280</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m).</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/d37cbde3659de8372e90f24df0537a32bb7006ba9c6730877e3f9d2e2d35f7fd.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
